			},
			"date": "2025-08-04T15:06:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I can use the shortcode in Nunjucks templates indeed. I want to keep using standard Markdown in content files, though, so the transform method is great anyway. I'll use attribute overrides when necessary.</p><p>I also commented the issue, with an additional solution to the one suggested by <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hachyderm.io/@TheRealNooshu\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>TheRealNooshu</span></a></span>, which is also interesting.</p>",
